# Route: guide 46 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Undead
# (1199 of 1215 eligible quests, 157.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 59 to
# 60, 18 quests, 0.6 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Undercity, Duskwood, Blasted Lands): Undercity -> near Undercity ->
# Undercity -> near Undercity -> Undercity -> near Undercity -> Undercity ->
# Darkshire -> Nethergarde Keep.
